,"target_id":"b1ec-d503-aaa2-440d"},{"link_uuid":"2f633280-a474-4477-8dfc-b62427f1b511","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"6ce9-9aad-9815-450b"},{"link_uuid":"42d2a5bf-e41c-4efa-8feb-fd99ab7b7492","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"2f3c-a34a-ea49-4003"},{"link_uuid":"dc178743-717e-4fa7-bc65-37c1154d37c7","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"39b2-4d57-46c5-4a26"},{"link_uuid":"b4e36cc4-5d30-4f9b-88a1-f8cc780461fe","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"41c2-f76b-750c-434d"},{"link_uuid":"ecb8cbd0-fe89-4902-9732-c978f514e807","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"0c3f-4d8d-9a20-4c56"},{"link_uuid":"9e8a684e-1d4b-466f-9c33-c99775af0235","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5834-b249-67c9-4139"},{"link_uuid":"8afa30f8-70b2-4957-990e-c3db9c4929f3","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1e09-0848-48b0-4046"},{"link_uuid":"ff936265-afbb-4d81-bbbf-f196a83cf3d0","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"9f63-65cd-82d7-4695"},{"link_uuid":"7c83add9-15fc-47c1-8aca-b7f6220cb087","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"69b0-09b1-ab21-4b35"},{"link_uuid":"69647c98-7a6a-46e8-bb3c-68ff6d88da3c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5e3f-d80c-381e-48f2"},{"link_uuid":"3e789e22-4d1a-4909-90cb-ef5bf2a314c7","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"53ab-af71-eabd-44d0"},{"link_uuid":"093a17d5-448d-4812-9655-d82cd27fbd8f","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"b984-fc7e-4baf-44b4"},{"link_uuid":"63a319f2-d99d-495e-81e7-0a34ac990a0a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"fed6-0dd0-a7f3-4e0b"},{"link_uuid":"1b07473e-3b3c-46e5-8008-b5304a434e00","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"bb7b-1afe-2fcb-48b9"},{"link_uuid":"29626cd8-e9fe-415f-b7c3-e560d533d64c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"ffea-dc25-3323-4d6e"},{"link_uuid":"422827dc-4f09-4227-90d1-d344361c5b1b","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"92b2-73be-ffe8-43ab"},{"link_uuid":"4eddab04-08fe-4b21-8380-49cfc77f2359","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"6a5c-0084-fbb8-4d9c"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe scripts cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `scripts/check_import_walk.py:1–37, 77–79` — Preserve package/script isolation semantics and explicit skip policy. Consumer: argparse consumes only the first docstring line.\n- `scripts/check_mcp_library_parity.py:2–59, 156–171, 291–321` — Preserve descriptors, correspondence, normalization, divergence reasons, stand-in recovery, manifest coherence. Consumer: argparse consumes only the first line.\n- `scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py:2–58` — Preserve seven kinds/partition, marker contract, ratchet and exit semantics, portability. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_orphaned_load.py:2–61, 75–91` — Preserve PPID+CPU signal, system exclusions, read-only triage, threshold/path basis. Consumer: none found.\n- `scripts/check_raw_git_writes.py:2–104` — Preserve Layer P/W/R3 semantics, sanctions, trust boundary, accepted residuals. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_repo_root_from_package.py:2–39` — Preserve wheel-install invariant, exact composing shape, sanction versus seam. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_repo_root_from_tracker.py:2–59, 83–88` — Preserve store invariant, wrapper shapes, sanction/seam distinction. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_server_manifest.py:2–26` — Preserve code/manifest parity and canonical optional fields. Consumer: none found.\n- `scripts/check_shellcheck.py:2–25` — Preserve warning severity required for SC2115, scope, missing binary fails. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_ssm_secret_state.py:2–45` — Preserve plaintext-state threat, exact violations, generated-expression exception, hermetic/no-secret-output contract. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_templatefile_escapes.py:2–28` — Preserve comments remain template text, declared-root rule, why ShellCheck cannot detect it. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_tickets_boundary.py:2–38` — Preserve relocatable store, four shapes, reasoned marker, legitimate exceptions. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/check_uv_pin.py:2–38` — Preserve exact single source, defeat modes, uv tag/digest agreement, portability. Consumer: none found.\n- `scripts/check_verify_gate_parity.py:2–27` — Preserve Verified superset rule, source-lane scope, justified exclusions. Consumer: none found.\n- `scripts/dependency_audit.py:2–37, 51–54, 191–199` — Preserve lane-aware verdicts, severity fallback, sibling-import requirement, call-time sleep seam. Consumer: full argparse `--help`.\n- `scripts/gen_env_registry.py:2–56, 72–109, 112–132, 151–173` — Preserve supported patterns, unknown-accessor/helper/stale-row failures, exclusions, update usage. Consumer: none found.\n- `scripts/install-gerrit-hook.sh:2–24` — Preserve common-dir/worktree safety, non-clobbering, idempotency, usage/env overrides. Consumer: manual source readers.\n- `scripts/jira_dc_capability_map.py:2–34, 52–57, 102–114, 549–577, 702–705, 721–724` — Preserve authoring-tool constraints, evidence capture, fail-soft digest, custom-field discriminator, artifact verification. Consumer: module docstring is argparse `--help`; L215–232 is an LLM tool contract and was intentionally not flagged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"scripts/check_import_walk.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_mcp_library_parity.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_orphaned_load.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_raw_git_writes.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_repo_root_from_package.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_repo_root_from_tracker.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_server_manifest.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_shellcheck.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_ssm_secret_state.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_templatefile_escapes.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_tickets_boundary.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_uv_pin.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/check_verify_gate_parity.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/dependency_audit.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/gen_env_registry.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/install-gerrit-hook.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"scripts/jira_dc_capability_map.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3de8-31a0-25ef-456d"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"3de8-31a0-25ef-456d","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"5f00-e694-dab6-4d1c","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in scripts — cohort 03: check_import_walk–jira_dc_capability_map","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ed892993-f29f-4831-83f8-4254b6df326e","a7ad175e-f858-4b9d-8c2a-c21192145908","166704f6-0b4b-4c21-a7c7-3b54934cc6b2","2f633280-a474-4477-8dfc-b62427f1b511","42d2a5bf-e41c-4efa-8feb-fd99ab7b7492","dc178743-717e-4fa7-bc65-37c1154d37c7","b4e36cc4-5d30-4f9b-88a1-f8cc780461fe","ecb8cbd0-fe89-4902-9732-c978f514e807","9e8a684e-1d4b-466f-9c33-c99775af0235","8afa30f8-70b2-4957-990e-c3db9c4929f3","ff936265-afbb-4d81-bbbf-f196a83cf3d0","7c83add9-15fc-47c1-8aca-b7f6220cb087","69647c98-7a6a-46e8-bb3c-68ff6d88da3c","3e789e22-4d1a-4909-90cb-ef5bf2a314c7","093a17d5-448d-4812-9655-d82cd27fbd8f","63a319f2-d99d-495e-81e